Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.91,0:00:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.31,0:00:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.49,0:00:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.29,0:00:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.73,0:00:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.99,0:00:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.65,0:00:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.59,0:01:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place that\Nthe end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.97,0:01:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary till\Nsomeone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.25,0:01:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, through\Nall the troubled times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.53,0:01:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.91,0:01:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.17,0:01:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.31,0:01:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.33,0:01:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.43,0:01:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.95,0:01:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.23,0:01:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.15,0:01:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.45,0:01:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.37,0:02:04.33,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(729,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(688,729,\1a&H00&)}To the Sea
Dialogue: 2,0:02:00.37,0:02:04.33,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(729,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}To the Sea
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.23,0:02:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.45,0:02:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.33,0:02:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rubber
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.24,0:02:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guy beat Captain Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.53,0:02:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even the Marines\Nwere a match for Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.97,0:02:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a man of a thousand plans,\Nand this guy still beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.51,0:02:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.42,0:02:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.45,0:02:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Monkey D. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.09,0:02:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only time a pirate should\Nabandon his name is when he dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.45,0:02:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would never lose to a\Ncoward who ditches his name,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.69,0:02:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,betrays his friends, and\Nruns from life on the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.39,0:02:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.69,0:02:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never heard that name before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.99,0:02:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should remember my name\Nfor the rest of your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.23,0:02:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause one of these days, I'm\Ngonna be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.95,0:02:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.01,0:02:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.11,0:02:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And never come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.65,0:03:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did good, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.45,0:03:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd expect even you to collapse\Nafter what you just went through?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.71,0:03:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.71,0:03:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, why were you so mad earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.35,0:03:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I truly hate people like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.25,0:03:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're so wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.97,0:03:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is not how friends should act.?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.41,0:03:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.23,0:03:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.63,0:03:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most pirates aren't the brave, honorable\Npeople you always make them out to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.25,0:03:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want some meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.99,0:03:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.55,0:03:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, think you can keep everything\Nthat just happened here secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.49,0:03:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? A secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.91,0:03:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't we want to\Nkeep all this a secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.25,0:04:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.43,0:04:02.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We put our lives on the\Nline to save the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.07,0:04:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now everyone will change\Ntheir opinion of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.21,0:04:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so instead of being Usopp the\Nliar, you'll be Usopp the hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.51,0:04:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.53,0:04:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to clear up\Nthis misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.29,0:04:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Misunderstanding?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.20,0:04:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was known as the Village Liar\Nbecause I lied all the time, Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.01,0:04:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.23,0:04:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were right not to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.57,0:04:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, there's no point in scaring\Npeople with something that's already over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.19,0:04:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I seriously doubt that any more pirates\Nlike Kuro and his gang will show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.43,0:04:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason for pirates to attack\Nour out-of-the-way little village.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.41,0:04:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So listen up, pretend\Nthis never happened, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.89,0:04:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was all just another\None of my great big lies
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.29,0:04:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I won't force you to, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.29,0:04:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.33,0:04:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever it takes for\Nthe good of the village, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.19,0:04:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too! Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.03,0:04:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lips are totally sealed, I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.93,0:05:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care who you allow is\NCall, will you? Will you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.91,0:05:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.09,0:05:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something just isn't right this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.37,0:05:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.15,0:05:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It kind of throws everything\Noff if he's not around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.91,0:05:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel so bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.21,0:05:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.87,0:05:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that screaming liar guy\Nnot coming to town today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.51,0:05:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That lying little twerp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.73,0:05:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the heck is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.23,0:05:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't think I hurt his\Nfeelings yesterday, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.75,0:05:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.07,0:05:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be up to his old tricks in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.61,0:05:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.97,0:05:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.17,0:05:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have been able to\Nprotect the village without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.33,0:05:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give credit where credit's due.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.17,0:05:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you'd just stood by and done nothing,\NI wouldn't have done anything either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.37,0:05:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.83,0:05:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares about any of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.53,0:06:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got my hands on this sweet, sweet\Ntreasure now, and I couldn't be happier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.57,0:06:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything that happened\Nhere today helped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.73,0:06:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've just come to a\Nvery difficult decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.63,0:06:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.51,0:06:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Usopp, what did you\Nwant to talk to us about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The three of you fought well against\Nthose terrible black cat pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.11,0:06:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As captain, I'm proud of you for\Nbeing so brave and courageous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.51,0:06:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.59,0:06:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we overcame our biggest and most important\Nbattle since we formed the Usopp Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.23,0:06:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,five years ago That was when you three\Nbrave soldiers were only four years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.95,0:06:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.86,0:06:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.78,0:06:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I know this is sudden,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.81,0:06:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I've decided that I'm going\Nto set out to sea by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.27,0:06:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm finally going to leave this\Nplace and become a real pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.45,0:06:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At first I wasn't sure what I would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.43,0:06:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't decide if I wanted\Nto stay here forever or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.45,0:07:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But once I saw them, I knew\Ndeep in my heart what I must do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.35,0:07:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel that, as a man, I must\Nset out to the vast ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.63,0:07:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I'm leaving this place behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.73,0:07:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I leave for one reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.45,0:07:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the great pirate flag\Nbeckons, you must heed its call!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.59,0:07:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, say it isn't so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.95,0:07:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lying again, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.57,0:07:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a bit hasty?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.37,0:07:30.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.81,0:07:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you loved this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.33,0:07:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's gonna happen to\Nthe Usopp pirates without you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.93,0:07:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been good to me, guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.29,0:07:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, I plan to leave without\Ntelling the villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.39,0:07:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give them my regards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.49,0:07:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, no, I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.77,0:07:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.85,0:07:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stay here, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.09,0:07:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp Pirates, do you remember this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.09,0:08:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where we first met\Nand formed the Usopp Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.13,0:08:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.29,0:08:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's that liar guy. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.77,0:08:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.91,0:08:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why are you so buddy-buddy with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.75,0:08:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Dai, you're famous!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.95,0:08:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're a really famous guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.03,0:08:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.47,0:08:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've come face to face with a man that\Nis known the world over as Captain Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.19,0:08:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, everyone in the\Nvillage calls you liar, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.93,0:08:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, from this day forth, you're\Nofficially members of the Usopp Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.95,0:08:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on! Man up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.67,0:08:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lot's happened since then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.83,0:08:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Cerberus!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.95,0:08:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scare it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.81,0:08:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.69,0:08:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.93,0:08:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flower storm!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.99,0:08:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.11,0:08:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But of course, I'm a\Nbrave warrior of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.43,0:09:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't talk about the old days!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.45,0:09:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pepper's right, it's much too painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.07,0:09:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This kind of life isn't like you, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.89,0:09:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.81,0:09:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you say that\Nyou're going to leave us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.05,0:09:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not serious, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.31,0:09:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're being stupid, Captain! Stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.09,0:09:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me what all your ambitions are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.71,0:09:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I crawl out, my\Ndream is to run a pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.49,0:09:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My whole life I've wanted\Nto be a master carpenter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.37,0:09:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goal is to become a writer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.87,0:09:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, swear to me now that each of\Nyou will continue on your paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.05,0:09:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise me that you will never let\Nthe fires of your ambitions die out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.35,0:09:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As of today, our group,\Nthe Usopp Pirates...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.11,0:10:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,...are disbanded!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.39,0:10:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that we've eaten, we\Nshould probably get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.29,0:10:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.77,0:10:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.79,0:10:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.03,0:10:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right being out of bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.85,0:10:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.43,0:10:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think now I can truly\Nstart recovering. You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.69,0:10:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my sickness this last year was caused by\Nthe mental shock of losing both my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.69,0:10:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Usopp's friendship helped\Nme start getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.51,0:10:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stay in bed forever, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.77,0:10:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've prepared a present for\Nyou from the bottom of my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.67,0:10:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to show you how grateful I am\Nfor everything you've done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be honored if you'd accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.71,0:10:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All packed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.19,0:10:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess it's farewell to this house, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.17,0:11:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.01,0:11:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.19,0:11:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stupid backpack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.03,0:11:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The real Caravelle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.83,0:11:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you actually giving this to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.95,0:11:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a token of my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.69,0:11:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a slightly older model,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.63,0:11:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I personally designed it\Nand she sails like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.03,0:11:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has a carvel-made Caravelle with\Nlateen sails and a central stern rudder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.07,0:11:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a fine ship and her\Nname is the Going Merry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.75,0:11:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain the rigging.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.59,0:12:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, about the Kruger\Nnet yard adjustment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.27,0:12:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may seem a little temperamental.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.35,0:12:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you'd be better off just\Nexplaining the technical stuff to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.01,0:12:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a cool ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.83,0:12:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you guys seen the front?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.25,0:12:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's totally awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.89,0:12:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've loaded it with all the provisions\Nyou might need on a long voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.99,0:12:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.90,0:12:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It leaves nothing to be tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.69,0:12:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That leaves nothing to be desired, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.29,0:12:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody stop this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.95,0:12:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.59,0:12:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.83,0:12:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.87,0:12:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we better stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.43,0:12:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That weirdo is on a collision\Ncourse with our boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.95,0:12:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, thanks, Kaya. Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.49,0:12:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.17,0:12:45.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna take to the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.99,0:12:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.90,0:12:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've decided to get going before\NI have time to change my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.41,0:12:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.71,0:12:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.73,0:12:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's time for you to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.85,0:12:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaya, don't be sad about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.45,0:13:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just think, the next\Ntime I come back here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.75,0:13:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you about adventures that'll\Nsound more like lies than my old lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.87,0:13:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.78,0:13:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.59,0:13:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.31,0:13:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope we meet again sometime!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.71,0:13:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.37,0:13:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, because I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.57,0:13:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you antisocial or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.87,0:13:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm taking off for life on the high seas,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.03,0:13:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I hope that we'll eventually\Nmeet again, that's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.59,0:13:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.95,0:13:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get on already. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.35,0:13:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're friends, right? So get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.75,0:13:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.21,0:13:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really a pirate captain now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.09,0:13:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.87,0:13:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.65,0:14:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There goes the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.39,0:14:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He fell in with some pretty awesome\Npeople, so I'm not too worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.97,0:14:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he'll be safe with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.75,0:14:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anybody\Nas strong as they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.85,0:14:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's always talked\Nabout becoming a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.05,0:14:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now he's headed\Noff to live his dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.87,0:14:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, the villagers are going to\Nbe sad when we break the news to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.07,0:14:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our captain was the only person who\Ncould liven things up around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.51,0:14:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.71,0:14:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I just had a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.95,0:14:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.79,0:14:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary? Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.39,0:14:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lying hurts, a lot Are you\Nreferring to Klahadore?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.31,0:14:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:45.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be talking about Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.95,0:14:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really wanted him to stay, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.35,0:14:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Kaya
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.49,0:14:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.49,0:14:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of the villagers told me a story\Nabout your good friend Usopp's childhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.11,0:15:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a short time after his father\Nleft the village to become a pirate,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.09,0:15:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his mother, whom he was\Nvery close to, passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.09,0:15:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.00,0:15:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.97,0:15:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.75,0:15:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are here, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.89,0:15:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.80,0:15:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.72,0:15:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mustn't shout.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.63,0:15:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.11,0:15:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom, we're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.41,0:15:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad finally came back for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.13,0:15:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you go with your\Nwild imagination again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.43,0:15:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You silly boy. It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.13,0:15:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He always said he'd come back for us and\Ntake us with him when you got better,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.57,0:15:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't he, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.39,0:15:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, my dear, your father\Nwon't be coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.85,0:15:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm proud to have married such a\Nbrave man who dared to chase his dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.55,0:15:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard about a special medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.49,0:15:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stuff can cure any sickness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.93,0:15:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.63,0:15:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dream too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.95,0:15:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a dreamer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.71,0:15:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm silly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.29,0:16:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.29,0:16:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.23,0:16:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm the son of a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.33,0:16:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise me one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.37,0:16:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise me you'll grow\Nup to be brave like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.69,0:16:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,PIRATES ARE COMING!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.11,0:16:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps out of loneliness,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.91,0:16:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he continued to shout it\Nafter his mother passed away,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.05,0:16:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the hopes that one day his father's\Npirate ship would be at the shore?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.39,0:16:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ready to spirit him away to the sea and\Ngive him a family that he never had.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.89,0:16:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The villagers say that his outlandish\Nlies contain his most heartfelt wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.19,0:16:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.10,0:16:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.03,0:16:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As someone else who lost both parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.15,0:16:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he saw you as a kindred spirit, and he\Ncouldn't sit by and ignore your suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.65,0:17:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for you, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.67,0:17:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to rise from the ashes\Nof tragedy and live up
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.79,0:17:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to the example that Usopp\Nworked so hard to set.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.01,0:17:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.17,0:17:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers to a new ship\Nand a new Gourmet! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.77,0:17:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said they were fighting\Nto live, not to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.41,0:17:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp's wild stories and outlandish lies\Nalways spoke of the joy of being alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.91,0:17:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They helped me through my grief by\Ncheering me up and telling me to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.17,0:17:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.87,0:17:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, we're really doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.33,0:17:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.57,0:17:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to follow in\Nour captain's footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.81,0:17:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.05,0:17:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pottery!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.65,0:17:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pottery! Pottery!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.17,0:17:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pottery!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.08,0:17:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pottery!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.63,0:17:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pottery!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.54,0:17:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My life starts now, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.73,0:17:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.17,0:18:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's wonderful, Miss Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.81,0:18:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.95,0:18:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.86,0:18:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.13,0:18:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a kid, I never stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.53,0:18:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Searching for a great treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.13,0:18:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a map in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.87,0:18:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I knew would lead me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.57,0:18:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to find my way to that place!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.71,0:18:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before someone could beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.59,0:18:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The promised land was in my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.77,0:18:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.87,0:18:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La, la, la, la.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.27,0:18:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.55,0:18:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La, la, la, la, la.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.03,0:18:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop chasing\Nit until it comes true!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.37,0:18:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the world ever changes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.01,0:18:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call out your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.49,0:19:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We return to the time when\Neverything's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.39,0:19:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you,\Nmy memories don't fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.63,0:19:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for that one true dream?

